  "result": "The decision is made in `src/hooks/shortcut-match.ts`. `matchesShortcut()` parses the shortcut tokens and compares the pressed key and modifier flags against them. It calls `prefersMetaKey(platform)`, which tests the platform string for mac, iphone, ipad or ipod. That result decides whether `mod` means Meta (Command) or Control.\n\n`src/hooks/use-keyboard-shortcut.ts` only wires this up. It reads `navigator.platform` and passes it into `matchesShortcut()` from a keydown listener, so it doesn't make the decision itself.\n\nANSWER: src/hooks/shortcut-match.ts",
